OL,16,G2245FSmall Boat by Vincent Delecroix
OL,17,     GTwo figures approach along the
OL,18,     Gshore, guilt and exhaustion
OL,19,     Gdistort the mirage. Desperate
OL,20,     Gpleas for salvation are hurled
OL,21,     Ginto the sea air. Whose soul is
OL,22,     Gin danger ?
